      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11777594685554504
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "They added that, after one  year the investment is returned to the investor with the  aforementioned interest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2078,
      "end": 2188,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10877121984958649
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "They also used to enter into an  agreement with the investor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2189,
      "end": 2250,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17143315076828003
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Both the accused Milind and Rupesh  gave bank details of their company.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2251,
      "end": 2322,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Milind",
