      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11412958055734634
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "4. In December 2019, the accused Milind induced the  informant to open a Demat account with the Angel Broking and  kept all the details of that Demat account with himself.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2864,
      "end": 3035,
      "entities": [
