      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06659181416034698
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Accused Milind executed another similar agreement in  December 2020 and gave one cheque of Rs.20 lakhs as security",
