      "start": 3396,
      "end": 3435,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13688482344150543
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "Thus, in all they had taken Rs.17 lakhs from the  informant on false inducement and had misappropriated the  amount.",
