    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that the Anjali Mukesh Mali vs The State Of Maharashtra on 15 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/183975821/\n3  co-accused Milind had a few criminal cases against him and,\n therefore, the banks were not permitting him to operate any bank  account.",
